  "description": "Pac-Man for the DualPanto, built up in levels: corridor, turns, pellets, junctions.",
  "script": "// Pac-Man for the DualPanto, built up in small steps: every level adds one new thing.\n// You are Pac-Man: the Me handle. The corridors are a haptic graph: the hand slides in a\n// groove, turns at the junctions and settles into dips at the corners and crossings.\n// It needs firmware with protocol revision 7.\n\n// R = start the current level again\nonKey(\"r\", () => panto.loadLevel(panto.level.name));\n",
